abstract: >-
  A collection of surgically bounded, executable ESS-MAI proof-of-concept
  capsules. It records experimental successes and failures as an advancement
  method while excluding the full ESS-MAI v1.8.9 core. C01 and C02 are
  reference-only and are not evidence.
